{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "587989817d8148340edb01e558b1baaedf8581956cc847c79472992c909605f5", "ja": "（今日は美奈子に誘われて、七夕まつりに行ってきた。\n会場から離れても、まだ熱気を感じる気がする……）", "zh": "（今天受美奈子邀请，去参加了七夕祭。感觉就算离开会场，似乎还能感受到那股热闹的气氛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "82be117bba23aedb54f68eaaec7102b14802a5a268c3690d43393138f4826cd5", "ja": "今日はありがとうございました！\nお休みなのに、わざわざ付き合ってもらっちゃって。", "zh": "今天谢谢你！\n明明是休息日，还特意陪我出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5fac2770c105c50b5613350e3b6585b8e90d42ec039ef14b2259239119e987aa", "ja": "いや。こちらこそ、ありがとうな。\nちょうど、気分転換をしようと考えてたんだ。", "zh": "不，我才要谢谢你。\n正好我也在考虑换换心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "7b3ec3a29aaa8ccc1788666f031120dd5dbc373d17553d8a05546bdee3bf9645", "ja": "ふふ、そうだったんですね。それにしても、\n今日は晴れてよかったです。おまつりもですけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，原来是这样啊。不过话说回来，今天放晴真是太好了。虽说对庆典来说是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "a32126f130d261dc189d35281e7441d298505779bb9e0244d33859b3617fc902", "ja": "織姫と彦星のふたりにとっても♪\nこのお天気なら、迷わず会いに行けそうです。", "zh": "对织女和牛郎来说也是♪\n天气这么好，他们应该能毫不迷惘地去相会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1ebd0d2b845fe6f3822509ef498dd723799c300fe132cbde83a559b03f3a4cb4", "ja": "そういえば、七夕はそんな話だったな。一年に一度、\nカササギの橋を渡って会いに行くんだっけ。", "zh": "说起来，七夕讲的就是这样的故事吧。他们一年见一次面，还要渡过鹊桥去相会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "b388779f24c33aa88f4d16e6aff7b33f792da3b22815cbe1c899b23421454ed1", "ja": "そうなんです！　だから私、「雨の日は会えなく\nなっちゃう」って。小さい頃、すごく心配してました。", "zh": "就是这样！所以我小时候一直很担心，觉得“下雨天就见不到面了”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bf743a0d9a4d33259b579207366f37f438f66c0e33b6fec5eb8771c4b7594550", "ja": "た、たしかに……。\nでも今日はその心配はなさそうだな。", "zh": "确、确实……不过今天看来不用担心这个了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "f7e8ce2b0d6eb4f8894856ba5e7bf2ca4bf009300b5cadc464357a396f1e5e0a", "ja": "そうですね。ふたりには、\n再会できた喜びをいっぱい味わってほしいです♪", "zh": "是啊。希望她们能尽情享受重逢的喜悦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "60aadb197d98a54db91f8d2bfc6f10db4b491de74899f65e065c0cb18b3bfe38", "ja": "一年に一回しか会えないですし……。\n天の川を眺めながら、ゆっくり過ごしてほしいなぁ。", "zh": "毕竟一年只能见一次面……  \n真希望他们能一边眺望银河，一边悠闲地度过这段时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1010_p", "source_sha256": "be68522c3ef5945244fad41021d38b5d7f52eb1f3884092a3b869f42cb6c8a73", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n地上から見上げるよりも、何倍も綺麗な光景だろうな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n那一定是比从地面仰望时美上好几倍的景色吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "490060a421d7be7a093ff47fc7ad5ccee1d54f862ee4e084701dd004e0dd0953", "ja": "ふふっ。そう考えると、とっても素敵ですね♪\n誰よりも近くで、天の川を見ながらふたりきりで……。", "zh": "呵呵，这么一想，真是太美好了♪\n两个人独处，在比任何人都更近的地方，一边看着银河……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "a5c11ef6b0dc488fb8a4c879eaf44970d5e4b33de479aa366449328fd899ff6d", "ja": "どんなご飯を食べてるんだろう……。", "zh": "不知道他们会吃什么样的饭呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1013_p", "source_sha256": "acf585e91fdee9b58aef1f112f93b44241ca9b48902a87bd2fd4a76258d2f0a9", "ja": "……ご飯？", "zh": "……饭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "f2fbb6c13d9a6eb18ceb3b1b9da1679c677403d61219444594f0a9d414186055", "ja": "はい！　中華料理だとは思うんですけど……。\n町中華というよりは、満漢全席みたいな感じかなって。", "zh": "是的！我觉得应该是中华料理……。\n不过与其说是街坊中华菜，不如说更像是满汉全席。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "26c351746c9dfe694dd7608bf155cd14a493a0f3aaccdfe3c42d6086930f3499", "ja": "でもでも……一番は、やっぱり手料理ですよね！\n思いがたくさん込められたご飯だったらいいなぁ♪", "zh": "不过不过……最重要的，果然还是亲手做的料理吧！\n要是那是倾注了许多心意的饭菜，就太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a7a688a000c8d1b9d2f4059785fe69df444f85371466729fb61db93148817058", "ja": "はは、美奈子らしいな。\nそういうことなら……織姫の手料理を食べてるのかな？", "zh": "哈哈，真有美奈子的风格。\n这么说来……是在吃织姬亲手做的饭吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "0d47720373107180a6bd4fcf8ac1164371a119b971370f13dfa24c3818140ed9", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかもしれませんね♪\n一年分の愛情とカロリーを、たっぷり込めたご飯……。", "zh": "呵呵，也许是吧♪\n满满融入了一年份的爱意和热量的饭菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "e17411cf379201b01fb08fb73662c7dd1a3f143e2eed14ef31a7be7efdc499f2", "ja": "いつか、私も……。\n{$P$}さんに食べてほしいです♪", "zh": "总有一天，我也……\n想让{$P$}先生尝尝看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1019_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "ef825b2e31630bc5865a5dec9a99c18c656d81f33018b81e4da2d230cace4d14", "ja": "一年分の愛情とカロリーを込めた、私の料理！\n今から考え始めれば、来年の七夕には間に合いますね！", "zh": "倾注了一整年爱意和热量的，我做的料理！\n现在开始考虑的话，明年的七夕就能赶上了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1021_p", "source_sha256": "45b9e54b9e966dce706a652384a105fe0b4a7f5c4ff81719b2625d53e65ab459", "ja": "来年……？", "zh": "明年……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0374_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "a29bac74c09d19af5b748f8876d23fcf8fe3a135c3f4cc9ed7907028c123476b", "ja": "はい！　織姫にも負けないくらいの料理を作りますから\n{$P$}さん、全部食べてくださいね♪", "zh": "好的！我会做出不输给织姬的料理，所以请{$P$}先生全部吃完哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
